WEBVTT

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:35.280
Shoot! Shoot!

00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:38.480
Listen! We can't allow them to escape!

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:41.000
You can't miss!

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:53.620
Brother?

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:56.740
Brother!

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:58.080
They're over there!

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:00.980
There! Catch her!

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:03.060
Don't let her run away!

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:05.460
You over there! You better not run away!

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:23.120
Stop, you brat!

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:34.080
Damn! Where did he go?

00:01:34.580 --> 00:01:36.880
He must still be nearby! Find him!

00:01:54.020 --> 00:01:55.620
What happened?

00:01:57.480 --> 00:01:59.920
Damn! Why aren't they dying!?

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:01.480
Shit!

00:02:01.480 --> 00:02:02.840
My sword went right through them…

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:15.240
Please…Someone save me.

00:02:59.380 --> 00:03:01.700
Well, well, what a pity...

00:03:02.520 --> 00:03:05.320
And here I was, planning to take care of them all on my own.

00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:08.760
Couldn't you have picked another day to work so fast, Hajime-kun?

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:12.740
I'm ony doing my job.

00:03:14.620 --> 00:03:18.080
But maybe if you had waited for them to kill the kid,

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:21.700
you could have spared us the trouble.

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:27.020
That decision isn't yours to make.

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:30.400
Luck is not your friend tonight.

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:34.600
Listen. Don't try to run.

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:42.300
Or else I'll have to kill you.

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:17.300
Chizuro, I'll return soon.

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:20.220
Please be careful out there, father.

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:23.920
They say Kyoto isn't very safe nowadays.

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:29.820
Don't worry, I'll keep writting to you.

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:30.820
Alright.

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:35.060
Take this.

00:04:57.920 --> 00:05:00.220
Heisuke, she seems to be waking up.

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:00.780
Oh!

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:04.040
Get Hijikata-san and the others.

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:06.040
Got it.

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:15.200
Hijikata-san, she woke up! What do we do now?

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:25.880
Can you promise me you won't make a commotion?

00:05:26.900 --> 00:05:27.220
Um.

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:40.660
I'm sorry that you have to be treated this way.

00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:46.000
Who the hell are you？

00:05:48.380 --> 00:05:50.320
We examined your belongings.

00:05:52.380 --> 00:05:54.840
How are you related to Kodo-san？

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:59.520
Father? You know my father？

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:00.220
What！？

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:04.380
So, you are Kodo-san's daughter？

00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:06.380
Yes.

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:12.360
Where is Kodo-san？

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:16.840
I've lost contact with him for half a year.

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:21.740
I came from Edo to find him.

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:25.580
But then I ran into those ronin.

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:28.880
It doesn't seem like she's lying.

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:31.300
What do you think, Kondou-san?

00:06:32.380 --> 00:06:34.380
What shall we do…

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:38.960
A relative of Kodo-san could be of use...

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:42.560
Kondou-san, a moment, please.

00:07:03.780 --> 00:07:07.160
We'll decide what to do tomorrow.

00:07:08.540 --> 00:07:11.200
Heisuke, stay with her and make sure she doesn't run.

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:13.720
Huh？Oh, alright.

00:07:14.440 --> 00:07:18.020
Really~ We're really not going to kill her?

00:07:19.680 --> 00:07:22.540
Souji, don't say those kinds of things.

00:07:23.180 --> 00:07:27.140
Hijikata-san, can I untie her?

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:35.720
Don't you dare run away. We -will- kill you. Remeber that.

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:51.100
Wait, I'll untie you.

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:53.860
What's this！

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:57.820
Souji tied this really tight.

00:07:58.520 --> 00:07:59.180
Um…

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:02.420
Where am I？

00:08:04.440 --> 00:08:07.560
Oh, right…this is the headquarters of the Shinsengumi.

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:08.780
Shinsengumi？！

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:16.580
Um…How are you related to my father？

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:21.920
Oh, it's already late,

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:23.840
so let's call it a day, alright?

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:29.380
You can get that mat from the closet and lay on it.

00:08:30.060 --> 00:08:32.100
I'll be just outside.

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:37.460
Oh, I'm Toudou Heisuke.

00:08:38.140 --> 00:08:39.620
You can call me Heisuke!

00:08:41.880 --> 00:08:45.180
Thank you very much for untying me.

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:49.460
I'm called Yukimura Chizuro.

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:52.340
Alright, Chizuro then.

00:09:02.900 --> 00:09:04.260
What are you doing？

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:06.420
Shhhh! Shhhh！

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:14.180
Sannan-san, what was it?

00:09:14.600 --> 00:09:16.060
It seems like it's him.

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:21.300
The handwritting is the same.

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:23.740
Isn't that letter…？

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:30.540
Last summer there was a fire in Kodo-san's clinic.

00:09:32.140 --> 00:09:35.780
Since then, he has been missing.

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:38.580
Is that... so…

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:44.960
We didn't find his body. It's possible he was somewhere else.

00:09:46.780 --> 00:09:49.260
These are the things we took from the wreckage of the clinic.

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:52.880
Perhaps you can recognize something.

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:02.720
When my father left Edo, I gave him this amulet.

00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:10.320
I see, you can keep it if you want.

00:10:11.020 --> 00:10:14.220
My father…do you think he's alive？！

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:17.720
There's a high possibility he is.

00:10:18.240 --> 00:10:20.660
Doctors trained in western medicine are invaluable

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:23.860
What about you? Have you heard anything？

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:26.800
Is that so…

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:34.860
Then would you be willing to help us search for your father?

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:36.860
Huh？I can  stay here and search for him？

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:39.300
Don't speak like that, Sannan-san.

00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:41.480
After what she saw yesterday.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:46.380
You know very well she has no choice, it's either stay or be killed.

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:50.600
Come on, don't be like that.

00:10:52.220 --> 00:10:56.600
Kodo-san and us are working together under the shogun.

00:10:57.320 --> 00:11:00.780
We're just as worried about your father as you are.

00:11:03.580 --> 00:11:09.700
So if you are willing, we would do our best to find him.

00:11:14.660 --> 00:11:18.120
I understand. Pleased to work with you.

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:24.480
Hum! Then from now on you are under our protection.

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:28.920
You might not want to hear this,

00:11:29.280 --> 00:11:31.760
but we must keep treating you as a boy.

00:11:32.280 --> 00:11:35.160
You aren't one of us, but there will be no special treatment.

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:36.200
Understood？

00:11:36.860 --> 00:11:37.300
Yes.

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:40.120
Isn't it great, Chizuro?

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:43.280
I can't say I'm not anxious,

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:46.200
but I'm relieved we won't have to kill a girl.

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:47.500
True.

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:52.820
I'm Nagakura Shinpachi! Let's all look for each other from now on, Chizuro-chan!

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:56.840
Yes! It's a pleasure to meet you!

00:11:58.520 --> 00:12:02.640
Vice-commander, what is to be her assignment?

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:06.320
Just make her someone's page.

00:12:07.020 --> 00:12:09.200
Perhaps Kondo-san's or Sannan-san's.

00:12:09.680 --> 00:12:11.580
That's no way to act, Hijikata-san.

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:15.920
The one who makes the proposition should assume responsibility.

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:16.980
Huh!?

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:21.420
Yes, she should be safe with Toshi.

00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:24.500
I see, Hijikata-kun.

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:26.660
Please take good care of her.

00:12:27.040 --> 00:12:28.960
Ah？Wa...Wait！

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:30.520
There's no getting out of it.

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:32.520
Then, we leave the rest to you.

00:12:49.820 --> 00:12:50.400
Father...

00:13:10.980 --> 00:13:11.620
If I may…

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:14.880
Hm? What is it?

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:17.720
Please let me go with you in your patrols.

00:13:19.220 --> 00:13:21.600
I can recognize my father at a glance.

00:13:22.180 --> 00:13:24.480
Please, take me along.

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:28.320
Do you even know what patrolling means？

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:31.440
You want to give us even more work？

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:36.980
No! My father taught me self-defense.

00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:38.540
I had classes.

00:13:39.260 --> 00:13:43.140
Interesting. Then I will test your ability.

00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:44.120
Follow me.

00:13:45.140 --> 00:13:48.060
Eh~ Never seen him acting like that.

00:13:48.060 --> 00:13:49.860
The sun must be getting into his head.

00:13:57.680 --> 00:14:00.960
Don't hold back. Strike me however you can.

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:06.160
But, couldnt you get hurt?

00:14:11.180 --> 00:14:13.940
You're facing Hajime-kun and you're worrying about that?

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:15.800
Your skill must be legendary.

00:14:16.400 --> 00:14:19.580
This isn't a joke! It's dangerous!

00:14:20.280 --> 00:14:26.040
But if you want to go outside, this is something you must do.

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:32.820
If you think it's too dangerous, you can strike with the back of the sword.

00:14:37.200 --> 00:14:38.080
Understood.

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:43.900
Prepare!

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:45.900
Come.

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:02.440
If this was the real thing, you'd be dead.

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:10.460
Your master should be proud.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.520
Your blade was not clouded.

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:20.960
Your skill should be enough for you to come with us.

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:25.480
Praise from Hajime-kun!

00:15:25.960 --> 00:15:28.400
That's no small feat.

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:30.680
Don't you agree, Hijikata-san?

00:15:32.680 --> 00:15:39.080
You must follow the captain's orders if you are to go on patrols. Understood?

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:45.160
Yes! Thank you!

00:16:16.960 --> 00:16:19.940
Have you heard about what the 1st Division just did?

00:16:16.960 --> 00:16:19.940
Have you heard about what the 1st Division just did?

00:16:20.740 --> 00:16:23.660
Several Choshu were caught and brought to the Maekawa House.

00:16:24.360 --> 00:16:25.960
The Vice Commander is currently questioning them.

00:16:28.720 --> 00:16:29.440
Chizuru！

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:30.800
Harada-san？

00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:34.540
Sorry but today's patrol might be too dangerous.

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:36.160
Did something happen？

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:37.620
Somewhat…

00:16:38.800 --> 00:16:42.680
But don't worry about it and return yo you room, alright?

00:16:43.340 --> 00:16:43.860
Yes!

00:16:54.340 --> 00:16:58.320
Shimada, we haven't received word from the Aizu clan yet?

00:16:58.740 --> 00:16:59.180
No.

00:17:00.020 --> 00:17:02.500
Toshi, we should just handle this ourselves.

00:17:03.300 --> 00:17:06.920
If we delay for too long, not only will the rebels escape,

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:08.920
Kyoto will be set to the torch.

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:12.180
Alright.

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:15.600
But we'll need to capture them by ourselves.

00:17:15.980 --> 00:17:17.600
Of course.

00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:20.060
We'll have to split.

00:17:20.520 --> 00:17:22.580
My group will go to Ikeda.

00:17:22.900 --> 00:17:26.200
Toshi, take your group to Shikokuya.

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:27.600
Got it.

00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:31.500
Shinsengumi, we're leaving!

00:17:50.940 --> 00:17:51.780
Go to the back door.

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:59.340
Can't you make an exception?

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:01.660
It's troubling to refuse someone who's begging...

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:03.660
...but today this place is booked.

00:18:03.900 --> 00:18:07.240
Then, I'll look someplace else.

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:08.980
I apologize.

00:18:09.760 --> 00:18:11.700
Please, come inside.

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:14.180
We've been waiting for a while.

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:33.240
Right now, the Shinsengumi are conducting an opperation to  apprehend the rebels trying to bring chaos to this capital.

00:18:33.820 --> 00:18:34.860
Vice-commander Sannan!

00:18:35.720 --> 00:18:38.440
Is that you, Yamazaki-kun？What is it？

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:42.940
There's not mistaking it, the rebels are meeting at Ikeda.

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:45.560
What's that！？

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:49.820
Commander Kondo asked if there's any word from clan Aizu so far.

00:18:50.680 --> 00:18:52.800
Unfortunately, no.

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:54.320
I see.

00:18:56.580 --> 00:18:57.520
Something the matter？

00:18:58.560 --> 00:19:06.300
Actually, we have received information about a man that strongly resembles Yukimura Kodo was sighted there.

00:19:08.260 --> 00:19:10.080
Are you certain of it？

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:12.260
No, I've yet to confirm it.

00:19:13.240 --> 00:19:14.540
At such a time…

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:18.960
Anyhow, you must inform Hijikata's group about Ikeda.

00:19:19.180 --> 00:19:20.060
Understood.

00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:27.380
We're racing against time, having only one person deliver the message won't be enough.

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:30.460
If only I was not wounded…

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:35.860
Um... Can't I do it?

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:39.680
Are you worried about your father？

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:41.680
Yes.

00:19:43.580 --> 00:19:46.440
Then repeat what you just heard to Kondou.

00:19:46.440 --> 00:19:49.460
Tell him he must converge the two teams again. (TELL HIM HE MUST WAIT FOR HIJIKATA)

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:51.120
Understood.

00:19:53.680 --> 00:19:55.220
Yamazaki's really late.

00:19:55.740 --> 00:19:56.300
Indeed.

00:19:57.480 --> 00:19:59.020
Kondo-san, what should we do？

00:19:59.560 --> 00:20:01.700
It would be shameful to just let them run.

00:20:03.380 --> 00:20:06.760
We have no choice but charging in as we are！

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:08.380
Now we're talking!

00:20:16.600 --> 00:20:19.080
By the powers of the Aizu clan and by imperial decree, the Shinsengumi

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:21.140
Shogunate interference, huh?

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:23.380
are here to restore order!

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:22.500
What！？

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:25.780
Search this whole house！

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:35.420
If you resist we'll show no mercy！

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:44.200
Miyabe-sensei, run！

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:45.360
I'll go ahead.

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:46.960
Hey, not fair!

00:20:56.660 --> 00:20:58.280
Excuse me, passing through.

00:20:58.640 --> 00:20:59.520
Excuse me！

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:01.820
Who are you！

00:21:04.440 --> 00:21:05.620
Kondo-san!

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:08.860
Yukimura-kun？What are you doing here?

00:21:09.100 --> 00:21:11.300
There's a message from Sannan-san!

00:21:11.300 --> 00:21:16.700
There has been no reply from the Aizu clan, so please wait for Hijikata-san's reinforcements.

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:18.700
Thank you for your hard work.

00:21:19.080 --> 00:21:21.560
However, there's no turning back now.

00:21:27.900 --> 00:21:28.940
Miyabe-sensei！

00:21:31.820 --> 00:21:34.240
Yukimura-kun, can you please look after his wounds?

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:35.660
Yes!

00:21:47.500 --> 00:21:49.860
See you. I'm heading back first.

00:21:50.460 --> 00:21:52.000
I'll leave the rest to you. (do whatever you like)

00:22:04.440 --> 00:22:05.820
Have they gone ahead?

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:09.580
Saito, take the front. Harada, flank them.

00:22:09.740 --> 00:22:10.520
Understood.

00:22:11.280 --> 00:22:15.140
Don't let anyone past you！Kill anyone who resists！

00:22:20.620 --> 00:22:22.680
How dare they only show up now.

00:22:24.480 --> 00:22:25.900
Who the hell are you?

00:22:26.080 --> 00:22:30.620
We are the Shinsengumi！We're currently undergoing an operation at Ikeda！

00:22:31.140 --> 00:22:32.620
You will not interfere！

00:22:32.820 --> 00:22:33.920
What's that！？

00:22:34.020 --> 00:22:37.200
Are the Wolves of Mibu calling us a hindrance？

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:40.240
Wolves of Mibu... is it？

00:22:42.300 --> 00:22:44.520
I'll be saying this for your own good.

00:22:45.380 --> 00:22:49.920
Whoever enters the premises without our uniform will be cut down.

00:22:50.660 --> 00:22:52.700
So if you value your lives stay where you are.

00:22:57.560 --> 00:23:01.040
Stop this. We have no reason to fight you.

00:23:01.700 --> 00:23:06.380
If you turn back now, we'll let you live.

00:23:06.820 --> 00:23:11.660
Ha？We can't let any Chosu people escape.

00:23:12.320 --> 00:23:15.720
We are not Choshu.

00:23:15.720 --> 00:23:19.600
We'll be the ones making the questions later！

00:23:36.180 --> 00:23:37.940
So you can play, huh?

00:23:42.900 --> 00:23:44.180
Bastard.

00:23:45.900 --> 00:23:46.540
Heisuke!

00:23:55.380 --> 00:23:58.160
Don't just sneak out through the back door.

00:24:01.100 --> 00:24:04.400
They're just trying to run away, let them be.

00:24:05.480 --> 00:24:08.980
I'll play with you if you want it so much.

00:24:10.540 --> 00:24:13.220
I'm fine with wanting a fight…

00:24:13.380 --> 00:24:16.260
But isn't it cheating to use a long-ranged weapon?

00:24:17.120 --> 00:24:19.160
Ha？Really？

00:24:19.460 --> 00:24:21.780
Your spear is not exactly close-range.

00:24:22.340 --> 00:24:23.860
Fair point…

00:24:26.900 --> 00:24:28.840
You didn't strike me as a coward,

00:24:29.560 --> 00:24:32.420
but isn't attacking me headfront foolish?

00:24:32.780 --> 00:24:38.100
Resorting to tricks is pretty low, as a warrior and as a man.

00:24:38.440 --> 00:24:39.560
Fair point.

00:24:44.780 --> 00:24:46.580
You're not bad.

00:24:47.100 --> 00:24:51.120
I am Shiranui Kyou.

00:24:51.380 --> 00:24:55.120
Shinsengumi's 10th division captain, Harada Sanosuke!

00:24:59.820 --> 00:25:03.000
You're interesting, as humans go.

00:25:12.200 --> 00:25:16.700
You shouldn't be challenging me with only that level of skill.

00:25:17.060 --> 00:25:21.160
I'm sorry, but we can't really allow anyone out alive.

00:25:26.400 --> 00:25:30.060
What a stubborn human!

00:25:30.960 --> 00:25:34.360
You should be alright now, I've stopped the bleeding.

00:25:38.440 --> 00:25:39.260
Father...

00:25:44.580 --> 00:25:45.900
Stop this, please.

00:25:46.520 --> 00:25:47.900
It's useless to ask for that.

00:25:49.960 --> 00:25:50.520
What！？

00:25:55.300 --> 00:25:56.600
What was that？

00:26:11.380 --> 00:26:15.140
Wait！I can still fight！

00:26:17.520 --> 00:26:19.780
So you want me to kill you that much.

00:26:20.200 --> 00:26:22.280
Then…die.

00:26:22.300 --> 00:26:23.080
Okita-san！

00:26:29.780 --> 00:26:30.420
Move！

00:26:31.020 --> 00:26:31.800
I won't！

00:26:37.660 --> 00:26:40.320
You…Are you one of us？

00:26:41.340 --> 00:26:46.780
Why are you helping these humans？Don't you know what you are?

00:26:47.480 --> 00:26:48.260
Then…

00:26:56.580 --> 00:26:57.960
Yukimura！Souji！

00:27:02.920 --> 00:27:04.680
Bastard, who the hell are you！？

00:27:04.900 --> 00:27:08.820
Oh, and why won't you introduce yourself first？

00:27:09.380 --> 00:27:12.420
Shinsengumi's vice commander, Hijiakata Toshizo！

00:27:13.840 --> 00:27:15.480
Kazama Chikage.

00:27:16.500 --> 00:27:19.260
I'll leave this woman in your care for now.

00:27:20.060 --> 00:27:21.520
Please take care of her for the time being.

00:27:24.860 --> 00:27:25.480
What！？

00:27:29.420 --> 00:27:30.240
He disappeared？

00:27:33.700 --> 00:27:35.700
Souji！Are you alright?

00:27:37.780 --> 00:27:39.900
You... why are you here?！

00:27:40.540 --> 00:27:41.900
Well…

00:27:42.260 --> 00:27:44.260
You're hurt,  let me see.

00:27:45.940 --> 00:27:46.900
I'm alright.

00:27:59.020 --> 00:27:59.560
Vice-Commander.

00:28:00.900 --> 00:28:01.900
How's Heisuke?

00:28:02.280 --> 00:28:04.700
He has sustained a wound to the head, but is safe.

00:28:05.180 --> 00:28:09.340
I see. Please check on the others too.

00:28:09.540 --> 00:28:09.840
Understood.

00:28:16.360 --> 00:28:18.380
Bring those who we arrested back to HEADQUARTERS MAYBE?

00:28:18.720 --> 00:28:21.280
Chase those that managed to escape.

00:28:21.420 --> 00:28:21.840
Yes.

00:28:23.420 --> 00:28:25.120
The rest

00:28:44.860 --> 00:28:45.760
Aren't those...

00:28:46.800 --> 00:28:48.380
…the Shinsengumi...

00:28:53.880 --> 00:28:59.340
The name of the Shinsengumi spread through Kyoto right to the Shogun.

00:29:01.140 --> 00:29:04.800
That might be the case, but Souji and Heisuke got wounded

00:29:04.980 --> 00:29:07.120
and the enemy managed to escape.

00:29:07.460 --> 00:29:10.980
There was a strong one in the back exit

00:29:11.480 --> 00:29:14.360
who managed to escape.

00:29:15.240 --> 00:29:19.200
There's already a unit on the hunt of the fugitives.

00:29:20.400 --> 00:29:20.980
Here.

00:29:21.200 --> 00:29:22.380
Yes, thank you.

00:29:23.000 --> 00:29:24.920
How's the situation with those severely injured?

00:29:25.800 --> 00:29:31.160
Captain Okita and captain Heisuke are doing better due to Yukimura-kun's timely measures.

00:29:31.340 --> 00:29:33.160
Their lives are not in danger.

00:29:34.200 --> 00:29:38.920
We have tried our best with the others, but we're not optimistic.

00:29:39.300 --> 00:29:40.100
I see...

00:29:41.340 --> 00:29:43.000
This is your first time seeing it each other, isn't it?

00:29:43.460 --> 00:29:45.640
They are the Inspection Unit, Yamazaki and Shimada.

00:29:47.500 --> 00:29:49.080
We've met last night,

00:29:49.400 --> 00:29:52.020
but let me reintroduce myself as Yamazaki Susumu.

00:29:53.200 --> 00:29:54.740
I'm Kai Shimada.

00:29:55.520 --> 00:29:58.900
It's a pleasue to meet you, I'm Yukimura Chizuru.

00:29:59.240 --> 00:30:05.000
It really shocked me when I saw Chizuro-chan at Ikeda last night.

00:30:05.720 --> 00:30:07.000
I apologize.

00:30:08.020 --> 00:30:11.540
There's no need for that. Thanks to you,

00:30:12.080 --> 00:30:14.940
now Souji and Heisuke are alive.

00:30:16.220 --> 00:30:22.480
And it was a relief not running into Kodo-san over there, wasn't it?

00:30:23.120 --> 00:30:23.700
Yes.

00:30:24.040 --> 00:30:26.880
Well, certainly there were some casualities,

00:30:27.560 --> 00:30:30.280
but I think we can be pretty happy about the results, right?

00:30:30.440 --> 00:30:34.060
Yes, now we just have to keep performing to that standard.

00:30:34.320 --> 00:30:35.440
Or it won't mean a thing.

00:30:38.940 --> 00:30:39.680
Sannan-san.

00:30:45.980 --> 00:30:48.040
What do you wish to ask？

00:30:55.180 --> 00:30:56.360
A fury that can move during the day and doesn't feel bloodlust...

00:30:56.360 --> 00:31:00.780
do you think something like that exists?

00:31:01.400 --> 00:31:05.440
You're refering to those men at Ikeda?

00:31:06.300 --> 00:31:06.740
Uh... no.

00:31:07.720 --> 00:31:12.520
It's hard to say, but I was curious if such a thing is even possible.

00:31:14.280 --> 00:31:16.260
It's possible.

00:31:17.880 --> 00:31:22.840
The Water of Life we have right now is something that came from the West.

00:31:24.160 --> 00:31:26.760
It has been researched before us,

00:31:27.280 --> 00:31:32.440
it wouldn't surprise me if there were perfected furies.

00:31:39.760 --> 00:31:42.780
As I thought…It healed even faster this time.

00:31:43.780 --> 00:31:46.420
You... Are you one of us？

00:31:48.600 --> 00:31:49.820
I wonder what he meant.

00:31:58.700 --> 00:32:01.080
Itou-san, it has been too long.

00:32:01.660 --> 00:32:05.260
Greeting from Koyomizu.

00:32:06.480 --> 00:32:08.580
So that's Itou Kashitarou.

00:32:09.120 --> 00:32:12.280
He's the fonder of the Hokushin Itto sword style.

00:32:12.680 --> 00:32:15.840
I heard he's an imperial nationalist.

00:32:15.960 --> 00:32:19.060
Why would someone such as him join the Shinsegumi?

00:32:20.860 --> 00:32:23.880
You saying he's like the Choshu, then?

00:32:24.700 --> 00:32:28.580
You really think someone like that can get along with us?

00:32:31.000 --> 00:32:33.040
Our team has increased again,

00:32:33.660 --> 00:32:37.820
I think we're going to need more space to accomodate everyone.

00:32:39.620 --> 00:32:41.240
How about the Nishi Hongwanji temple？

00:32:47.340 --> 00:32:51.880
The Nishi Hongwanji temple has been cooperating with the Choshu. Some of their ronin have been staying there.

00:32:52.920 --> 00:32:55.760
I hardly think we would be welcome there.

00:32:56.560 --> 00:32:58.360
That's precisely its advantage.

00:32:59.620 --> 00:33:02.640
It's big enough to place our number of soldiers,

00:33:03.080 --> 00:33:08.260
it's also near the center of Kyoto.

00:33:08.620 --> 00:33:10.700
And if we should move into the temple,

00:33:10.840 --> 00:33:12.560
it would  rob the Choshu of one of their hideouts.

00:33:13.400 --> 00:33:19.500
It would be uncouth to use force against men of the cloth.

00:33:19.500 --> 00:33:21.120
Such dishonor would bring consequences.

00:33:23.040 --> 00:33:28.380
We can't be enforcers in Kyoto without using force.

00:33:29.240 --> 00:33:31.880
What do you think, Sannan-san？

00:33:33.520 --> 00:33:38.440
Though I understand why you're more faint-hearted, there's really no need.

00:33:39.100 --> 00:33:39.940
Faint-hearted?

00:33:40.840 --> 00:33:45.420
Even if you can't use a sword anymore...

00:33:45.840 --> 00:33:51.600
I'm sure your wit and foresight will continue to be a great asset to the Shinsengumi.

00:33:51.900 --> 00:33:55.260
Itou-san, perhaps I didn't hear you right.

00:33:56.660 --> 00:33:58.200
...Hear me right?

00:33:58.760 --> 00:34:02.280
Sanan-san's smart, I'll give you that.

00:34:02.720 --> 00:34:07.120
But he is also a swordsman of the Shinsengumi!

00:34:07.980 --> 00:34:08.900
Hijikata-kun...

00:34:11.200 --> 00:34:12.760
My arm is…

00:34:14.380 --> 00:34:16.580
Oh dear.

00:34:16.860 --> 00:34:17.980
That was terrible rude of me.

00:34:18.580 --> 00:34:21.640
I'm anxiously waiting for your arm to get better soon.

00:34:26.340 --> 00:34:28.360
Um, what Itou-san said is right,

00:34:28.700 --> 00:34:32.060
the Nishi Hongwanji temple sounds like a good choice.

00:34:32.700 --> 00:34:34.780
What do the others think?

00:34:39.800 --> 00:34:41.940
Um... Here's the tea...

00:34:43.000 --> 00:34:48.020
Maybe it is time I'm replaced.

00:35:02.020 --> 00:35:02.740
Sannan-san.

00:35:08.160 --> 00:35:09.700
What is it？

00:35:10.300 --> 00:35:13.840
Is there anything I can help you with?

00:35:17.280 --> 00:35:19.940
Do I look that pitiful to you?

00:35:20.540 --> 00:35:21.020
Huh？

00:35:22.920 --> 00:35:24.940
There's something I need to show you.

00:35:39.500 --> 00:35:40.340
Enter.

00:35:56.940 --> 00:35:57.780
Yukimura-kun.

00:36:09.440 --> 00:36:10.340
Dinner's here.

00:36:13.960 --> 00:36:15.520
What are these people?

00:36:17.560 --> 00:36:22.500
They are the victims of Kodo's experiments.

00:36:23.520 --> 00:36:26.680
Because of that drug, they know have the urge to drink blood.

00:36:27.000 --> 00:36:30.580
I'm certain you've seen what I'm talking about.

00:36:36.460 --> 00:36:40.940
This drug first came from the West.

00:36:41.540 --> 00:36:47.900
We call it the Water of Life, and those who take it, furies.

00:36:48.700 --> 00:36:53.160
They have far superior strength and healing abilities than humans.

00:36:53.880 --> 00:36:57.200
And should have become the new power of the Shisengumi.

00:36:57.940 --> 00:37:01.120
But they have one fatal flaw.

00:37:02.840 --> 00:37:07.440
Our orders from the Shogun is find a way to overcome that weakness.

00:37:08.380 --> 00:37:15.100
Kodo-san has used the Shinsengumi as his test subjects,

00:37:15.540 --> 00:37:22.100
but when he disappeared, his research was stopped.

00:37:22.680 --> 00:37:27.580
Using what he left behind, I have produced this.

00:37:28.280 --> 00:37:33.660
If I drink it now, it might heal my arm.

00:37:34.160 --> 00:37:35.060
Might？

00:37:35.780 --> 00:37:38.220
You don't need to resort to that, Sannan-san!

00:37:38.220 --> 00:37:41.960
If I don't do this my arm will never heal！

00:37:42.540 --> 00:37:46.060
I'm a waste as a cripple.

00:37:46.060 --> 00:37:47.500
That's a lie！

00:37:48.000 --> 00:37:50.100
Everyone cares about you…

00:37:50.360 --> 00:37:55.220
My life as a swordsman has already ended, but if I am to become the living dead…

00:37:55.840 --> 00:37:58.240
at least let me die with the dignity of a full human.

00:37:59.320 --> 00:38:00.380
Stop it！

00:38:13.260 --> 00:38:14.480
Sannan-san…

00:38:30.420 --> 00:38:36.100
I can never forgive your father for doing this！

00:38:36.600 --> 00:38:41.400
Sneaking this poison to the Shinsengumi.

00:38:41.400 --> 00:38:42.400
Sannan-san…

00:39:09.800 --> 00:39:11.700
A fury...?

00:39:13.140 --> 00:39:14.140
What's that noise？

00:39:14.460 --> 00:39:16.300
Hijikata-san, over that warehouse.

00:39:21.060 --> 00:39:22.660
Yukimura, what are you doing here?

00:39:27.920 --> 00:39:30.180
What the hell happened here？

00:39:33.780 --> 00:39:34.380
You…

00:39:37.300 --> 00:39:41.640
Hijikata-san, what's going on？

00:39:42.860 --> 00:39:44.300
I have no idea.

00:39:48.240 --> 00:39:49.240
How's Sannan-san?

00:39:54.000 --> 00:39:56.580
It looks like he took the Water of Life.

00:39:57.180 --> 00:39:58.020
And now…

00:39:58.600 --> 00:39:59.100
Shit.

00:40:01.020 --> 00:40:03.540
Don't let anyone else in here.

00:40:04.100 --> 00:40:05.540
Call for help in a little while,

00:40:05.860 --> 00:40:07.540
and do not take your eyes off Sannan-san.

00:40:07.660 --> 00:40:08.640
Understood.

00:40:08.640 --> 00:40:08.940
Come.

00:40:13.580 --> 00:40:15.420
What the hell are you?

00:40:17.560 --> 00:40:19.800
The same thing happened at Ikeda.

00:40:21.880 --> 00:40:23.940
Your wound healed immeaditely.

00:40:24.700 --> 00:40:26.620
Just like a furie's.

00:40:29.040 --> 00:40:31.140
So stop fucking around and tell me the truth.

00:40:34.680 --> 00:40:38.780
I have known about this power since I was young.

00:40:39.980 --> 00:40:44.560
But my father taught me to not let others know.

00:40:48.940 --> 00:40:52.780
My father…Please let me find him.

00:40:53.660 --> 00:40:56.340
I want to ask him about this power…

00:40:57.100 --> 00:40:59.740
And I want to know what kind of man he really is.

00:41:00.840 --> 00:41:06.160
I want to know the reason why he did the things he did.

00:41:07.120 --> 00:41:08.160
I beg you.

00:41:16.620 --> 00:41:20.000
Did Sannan-san see your power?

00:41:21.100 --> 00:41:21.640
Probably.

00:41:22.920 --> 00:41:23.640
I see.

00:41:29.400 --> 00:41:31.740
It's not that I trust you.

00:41:32.340 --> 00:41:36.300
But I will keep your secret.

00:41:38.120 --> 00:41:40.140
Don't let the others know about it.

00:41:41.620 --> 00:41:44.520
You make sure of that, and I won't break my word.

00:41:49.140 --> 00:41:50.600
How's Sannan-san?

00:41:51.280 --> 00:41:54.400
He's peaceful, but he hasn't regained consciousness.

00:41:56.160 --> 00:41:56.740
Um.

00:42:02.760 --> 00:42:03.720
This.. .?

00:42:05.040 --> 00:42:09.580
You have just returned from Edo but there's something you should know.

00:42:10.620 --> 00:42:13.640
The Water of Life succeeded？

00:42:13.920 --> 00:42:17.180
Yes. My left arm has completely healed.

00:42:17.520 --> 00:42:19.820
That's really great,

00:42:20.100 --> 00:42:24.160
but then, why do we have to say Sannan-san has died?

00:42:24.760 --> 00:42:27.420
To protect the secret "Water of Life".

00:42:27.800 --> 00:42:31.860
This is not something that Itou can know about.

00:42:32.280 --> 00:42:32.720
Eh？

00:42:34.000 --> 00:42:36.960
This secret investigation was given to us by the Shogun.

00:42:37.460 --> 00:42:43.760
It's the kind of information we can only share with people we absolutely trust.

00:42:54.980 --> 00:42:58.280
Heisuke-kun! Welcome back.

00:42:58.600 --> 00:42:59.500
Chizuro...

00:43:01.980 --> 00:43:02.940
Is something the matter？

00:43:03.580 --> 00:43:04.940
Ah…It's nothing.

00:43:05.780 --> 00:43:09.240
A lot of things happened ever since I came back from Edo.

00:43:10.080 --> 00:43:13.020
I wonder if Itou-san is getting along with them.

00:43:15.200 --> 00:43:18.100
I'm the one who introduced him to Kondo-san.

00:43:19.420 --> 00:43:23.780
And it led to Sannan-san doing what he did,

00:43:24.920 --> 00:43:26.880
I wonder if I'm not also to blame.

00:43:28.020 --> 00:43:30.080
I don't think it's your fault.

00:43:30.980 --> 00:43:34.480
If my father hadn't come here with that drug,

00:43:35.580 --> 00:43:37.760
then Sannan-san wouldn't have...

00:43:42.820 --> 00:43:44.940
What will happen to us now...

00:43:56.460 --> 00:43:58.980
I thank you for your clan's support.

00:43:58.980 --> 00:44:02.420
I'm looking forward to cooperating together.

00:44:02.760 --> 00:44:07.280
You're a loyal subject of the Emperor, you may use our strength as needed.

00:44:08.720 --> 00:44:10.220
Your words seem very solid.

00:44:11.880 --> 00:44:13.200
I will take them to heart.

00:44:15.820 --> 00:44:21.820
I've heard some interesting things about the Shinsengumi.

00:44:21.960 --> 00:44:24.800
Oh, really？

00:44:25.740 --> 00:44:27.980
Kazama, where are you going？

00:44:28.580 --> 00:44:30.160
We're still in the middle of this meeting.

00:44:31.040 --> 00:44:35.060
It's really not a duty of mine to accompany them to the end.

00:44:36.360 --> 00:44:41.720
But those animals really enjoy their intrigue and betrayals, don't they?

00:44:42.840 --> 00:44:46.820
Personally, I'm just using them as a way to get that woman.

00:44:47.140 --> 00:44:50.000
The demon one you saw at Ikeda?

00:44:50.440 --> 00:44:54.600
I really can't allow another demon to stay with scum like this,

00:44:54.760 --> 00:44:56.900
we demons must have some pride.

00:45:01.700 --> 00:45:03.300
See you, Chizuro.

00:45:03.680 --> 00:45:05.500
We'll be continuing our patrol in this direction.

00:45:06.100 --> 00:45:07.500
Alright, please be careful.

00:45:08.140 --> 00:45:10.520
Souji, I'll leave her to you.

00:45:10.680 --> 00:45:14.140
Yes, yes. My, aren't you overprotective?

00:45:14.140 --> 00:45:16.420
Huh？Care to repeat that？

00:45:16.680 --> 00:45:17.960
No, it was nothing.

00:45:21.800 --> 00:45:24.040
A western doctor?

00:45:24.780 --> 00:45:25.740
No, nothing.

00:45:26.180 --> 00:45:29.400
I understand. Thank you.

00:45:40.040 --> 00:45:41.440
Are you feeling well？

00:45:51.500 --> 00:45:53.700
Okita-san, what happened？

00:45:55.860 --> 00:45:56.760
Okita-san！

00:46:00.520 --> 00:46:01.460
Please use this.

00:46:08.760 --> 00:46:11.120
You were accompanying him, weren't you?

00:46:11.840 --> 00:46:15.320
What were you thinking, leaving someone sick alone?

00:46:16.000 --> 00:46:17.740
I'm sorry…

00:46:18.400 --> 00:46:22.480
I've been keeping it a secret, she didn't know about it.

00:46:23.840 --> 00:46:27.400
So don't blame her.

00:46:28.960 --> 00:46:31.620
As you say…What is your name？

00:46:31.980 --> 00:46:33.500
Chizuro Yukimura.

00:46:34.160 --> 00:46:38.460
Um…I can give you a new handkerchief,

00:46:38.880 --> 00:46:40.340
can I know your name and residence?

00:46:40.960 --> 00:46:42.840
I'm Nagumo Kaoru.

00:46:43.560 --> 00:46:45.600
But you don't need to concern yourself about it.

00:46:47.580 --> 00:46:53.000
I hope we will meet again, Chizuro-san.

00:46:58.180 --> 00:47:00.140
Okita-san, since when have you been like this?

00:47:00.460 --> 00:47:01.780
Eh？What do you mean？

00:47:04.620 --> 00:47:06.620
Coughing up blood！

00:47:07.000 --> 00:47:08.280
Don't make such a fuss about it.

00:47:08.480 --> 00:47:09.960
I'm not making a fuss!

00:47:11.180 --> 00:47:12.340
You have a fever...

00:47:14.340 --> 00:47:15.060
it can't be…

00:47:15.580 --> 00:47:18.100
Tuberculosis, you mean？

00:47:19.760 --> 00:47:22.180
If you try to tell the others,

00:47:23.460 --> 00:47:25.500
I'll have no choice but to kill you.

00:47:28.020 --> 00:47:29.300
So it's true？

00:47:29.540 --> 00:47:33.820
According to the doctor, it's going to be terminal.

00:47:34.020 --> 00:47:37.460
I'm sure the doctor didn't say.

00:47:38.280 --> 00:47:41.720
If you part from the Shinsengumi for a while to rest...

00:47:41.720 --> 00:47:42.700
That's impossible.

00:47:43.460 --> 00:47:44.500
And why's that?

00:47:45.280 --> 00:47:48.800
There's not much I can do,

00:47:49.300 --> 00:47:53.920
except to cut down anybody in the Shinsengumi's way.

00:47:54.600 --> 00:47:56.580
If I don't have much time left, all the more important it is to stay.

00:47:57.280 --> 00:47:59.940
Being here is the only thing I've got left.

00:48:00.500 --> 00:48:01.060
Okita-san.

00:48:04.600 --> 00:48:07.280
I won't tell the others.

00:48:07.640 --> 00:48:09.320
But you have to promise me,

00:48:09.920 --> 00:48:13.560
you will stop drinking and take your medication.

00:48:13.560 --> 00:48:15.320
You're really noisy.

00:48:19.080 --> 00:48:23.920
Well, if I must, I'll do as you say.

00:48:32.700 --> 00:48:38.800
Say, you think this is something the Water of Life would cure?

00:48:43.960 --> 00:48:47.060
Just kidding. Let's head back.

00:48:55.880 --> 00:48:57.880
You're leaving？！

00:48:58.800 --> 00:49:00.320
I know perhaps this is unexpected,

00:49:00.880 --> 00:49:03.340
but I hope we might divide our forces.

00:49:03.700 --> 00:49:06.620
Spare me the crappy sophistry！

00:49:07.160 --> 00:49:09.900
Then, I have something to ask you as your military advisor,

00:49:10.660 --> 00:49:15.540
is there something you are hiding from me?

00:49:16.040 --> 00:49:17.040
Hiding？

00:49:17.440 --> 00:49:22.800
Some strange rumors have come to me from the soldiers.

00:49:24.780 --> 00:49:28.760
Like witnessing the late Sannan-san at night.

00:49:30.880 --> 00:49:32.960
If it's just a baseless rumor, then no matter,

00:49:33.720 --> 00:49:38.240
I wasn't the one to go through the investigation of it.

00:49:38.820 --> 00:49:40.820
That's what I came here to discuss.

00:49:41.940 --> 00:49:48.260
Oh, I see. So you put your little boys digging around.

00:49:49.320 --> 00:49:54.240
What If I told you it's just a baseless rumor.

00:49:54.420 --> 00:49:55.500
What would be your answer？

00:49:56.240 --> 00:49:59.000
Things have surely be kept hidden from me,

00:49:59.260 --> 00:50:02.200
but you know very well about our issues working together.

00:50:03.060 --> 00:50:03.960
What！？

00:50:04.660 --> 00:50:07.680
If your mind is already made up.

00:50:07.880 --> 00:50:10.220
I'm glad you understand.

00:50:18.160 --> 00:50:20.660
You lot have anything you want to add?

00:50:30.040 --> 00:50:31.040
Saito-san.

00:50:39.000 --> 00:50:40.300
How many times has it been,

00:50:41.380 --> 00:50:43.540
that I've watched the cherry blossoms in here.

00:50:44.460 --> 00:50:48.340
Everything changes with time.

00:50:49.240 --> 00:50:51.140
World affairs, ideologies,

00:50:51.260 --> 00:50:53.420
And even... the Shinsengumi.

00:50:54.800 --> 00:50:58.960
Saito-san, are you leaving because you have changed?

00:51:02.280 --> 00:51:05.820
I believe in precisely those things that do not change.

00:51:13.300 --> 00:51:15.800
Hajime-kun, thanks for waiting...

00:51:16.340 --> 00:51:18.180
Ah, Chizuro...

00:51:19.600 --> 00:51:24.300
I'm sorry I won't be able to help you search for your father til the very end.

00:51:25.020 --> 00:51:25.700
It's alright.

00:51:28.180 --> 00:51:33.860
I just don't know who is right anymore.

00:51:34.720 --> 00:51:39.480
Even if I invited Itou-san here,

00:51:39.640 --> 00:51:42.060
I need to see it for myself, who is right.

00:51:44.640 --> 00:51:45.180
Ah.

00:51:48.080 --> 00:51:51.820
Please don't look at me like that, Chizuro.

00:51:57.740 --> 00:51:59.800
Be careful, Heisuke-kun.

00:52:00.520 --> 00:52:02.720
You too, Chizuro.

00:52:17.320 --> 00:52:20.480
Why are you two drinking over here?

00:52:20.960 --> 00:52:24.620
Oh, it's you Chizuro, wanna join us?

00:52:24.740 --> 00:52:27.860
Don't be stupid, she can't drink.

00:52:28.060 --> 00:52:29.640
Why you inviting her for.

00:52:29.940 --> 00:52:36.380
I feel like something's missing. You get that?

00:52:37.300 --> 00:52:38.300
Yes.

00:52:40.300 --> 00:52:43.360
I wonder if Heisuke is doing alright.

00:52:50.120 --> 00:52:51.560
Chizuro, return to your room.

00:52:52.180 --> 00:52:52.620
Sano！

00:52:52.780 --> 00:52:53.320
Yes.

00:53:05.380 --> 00:53:07.460
I've allowed you to play for too long.

00:53:07.740 --> 00:53:10.440
Who knew you would choose to desecrate holy grounds with your presence.

00:53:11.040 --> 00:53:12.120
Wait for me here.

00:53:12.840 --> 00:53:13.700
Alright, alright.

00:53:21.400 --> 00:53:23.320
Looks like it's going to be dangerous out there.

00:53:24.000 --> 00:53:26.460
Yukimura-kun, I need you to stay in your room.

00:53:26.740 --> 00:53:27.840
How futile.

00:53:55.160 --> 00:53:56.700
Shiranui, wasn't it?

00:53:57.160 --> 00:53:59.040
I'll be your opponent.

00:53:59.260 --> 00:54:01.180
Ah, it's you!

00:54:01.980 --> 00:54:05.580
Harada-kun, what's happening here?

00:54:05.920 --> 00:54:07.720
These are the ones who escaped from Ikeda.

00:54:07.860 --> 00:54:09.320
They came back to attack us!

00:54:09.600 --> 00:54:14.840
So you're the ones that wounded Okita-kun and Heisuke-kun.

00:54:22.640 --> 00:54:23.460
A fury.

00:54:31.640 --> 00:54:33.160
That sword you carry.

00:54:33.540 --> 00:54:35.420
You are from the same family as Kodo.

00:54:36.800 --> 00:54:38.580
You know my father？

00:54:38.940 --> 00:54:41.440
You think that's your father？

00:54:41.700 --> 00:54:42.140
Huh？

00:54:48.620 --> 00:54:51.220
Come with me, and you'll understand everything.

00:55:10.240 --> 00:55:12.900
I have what I want. We're done.

00:55:14.280 --> 00:55:16.500
You're taking the fun out of it.

00:55:16.720 --> 00:55:20.680
We stay here for too long and these human's stink might catch on.

00:55:20.680 --> 00:55:24.340
I'm here only to take this demon woman home.

00:55:24.620 --> 00:55:25.440
Stop！

00:55:35.260 --> 00:55:39.260
Turning your sword on me, how interesting.

00:55:44.620 --> 00:55:46.120
Then play with me.

00:55:57.220 --> 00:55:58.780
Are you surprised?

00:55:59.460 --> 00:56:02.260
This is the true strength of a demon.

00:56:02.700 --> 00:56:03.400
Demon？

00:56:04.120 --> 00:56:07.500
That girl, she's also one of us.

00:56:07.700 --> 00:56:09.780
Can't waste that on a human.

00:56:11.040 --> 00:56:12.500
I don't give a shit.

00:56:13.020 --> 00:56:17.540
She's under our protection, so you won't have it your way.

00:56:17.660 --> 00:56:23.760
We can't allow our kind to fraternize with those fakes.

00:56:42.140 --> 00:56:43.160
Sannan-san！

00:57:04.620 --> 00:57:05.500
Yukimura！

00:57:11.260 --> 00:57:14.280
Why would a demon ever protect a human？

00:57:14.540 --> 00:57:18.280
I am no demon！Leave this place!

00:57:18.800 --> 00:57:20.740
If you refuse to acknowledge it,

00:57:22.540 --> 00:57:23.760
tell me your name.

00:57:25.220 --> 00:57:27.560
Yukimura Chizuro.

00:57:28.000 --> 00:57:29.340
The "Thousand Cranes",  is it?

00:57:30.040 --> 00:57:34.000
They are a large ancient clan of demons from the northeast.

00:57:34.000 --> 00:57:36.680
And you are certainely one of them.

00:57:37.220 --> 00:57:39.600
Your name and your sword prove it.

00:57:53.880 --> 00:57:57.620
Do you see now? You are no human.

00:57:58.540 --> 00:58:00.920
I…I…

00:58:05.380 --> 00:58:08.420
You stand in the house of the wolves of Mibu,

00:58:08.960 --> 00:58:12.480
there are no " humans" here in the first place！

00:58:13.300 --> 00:58:15.320
I won't let you screw us over.

00:58:19.120 --> 00:58:20.020
Hijikata-san...

00:58:21.780 --> 00:58:26.840
I…I refuse to go with you!

00:58:31.520 --> 00:58:33.040
How depressing.

00:58:34.380 --> 00:58:35.040
We're leaving.

00:58:35.240 --> 00:58:38.560
What？You just do whatever you please.

00:58:39.520 --> 00:58:40.780
We're leaving.

00:58:45.800 --> 00:58:48.420
Demons and humans cannot coexist.

00:58:48.840 --> 00:58:52.080
If you want to carry on that fantasy of protecting her, do so,

00:58:52.840 --> 00:58:57.820
but you will fail, and when you do, I'll get her.

00:59:16.300 --> 00:59:18.200
Can't believe she really is a demon.

00:59:18.700 --> 00:59:20.200
It's unbelivable.

00:59:20.480 --> 00:59:23.260
Was she.. unaware of it?

00:59:25.080 --> 00:59:29.480
After seeing her wounds close up just like a fury's,

00:59:29.780 --> 00:59:30.960
I can't say it's a lie.

00:59:31.740 --> 00:59:32.540
I see.

00:59:41.380 --> 00:59:42.420
Now that was working hard.

00:59:46.880 --> 00:59:47.820
Are you alright?

00:59:48.020 --> 00:59:48.400
Huh？

00:59:49.720 --> 00:59:52.660
Looks like something's troubling you.

00:59:55.460 --> 00:59:58.000
I feel it's not right for me to stay here.

00:59:59.860 --> 01:00:02.840
It has been chaos because of me.

01:00:03.440 --> 01:00:06.020
It's a men's duty to protect a woman in need.

01:00:06.480 --> 01:00:08.300
So don't worry about it.

01:00:09.200 --> 01:00:11.820
You're not the one responsible for this attack.

01:00:12.120 --> 01:00:15.900
If anything, it's our fault for not being able to handle them.

01:00:17.160 --> 01:00:19.720
You even fought alongside us.

01:00:20.160 --> 01:00:23.440
That's enough reason for you to be here.

01:00:23.980 --> 01:00:28.100
It doesn't matter what or who you are.

01:00:32.440 --> 01:00:33.860
You're you.

01:00:40.660 --> 01:00:44.020
Saito？How are you here？

01:00:44.660 --> 01:00:48.160
Saito's back in the Shinsengumi starting today.

01:00:49.220 --> 01:00:50.160
What's that supposed to mean？

01:00:52.140 --> 01:00:55.120
Actually under Toshi's orders,

01:00:55.500 --> 01:00:58.320
Saito's been spying for us on Itou's group.

01:01:00.420 --> 01:01:02.360
Itou-san has formed an alliance with the Satsuma clan,

01:01:02.940 --> 01:01:08.020
And they are... planning to kill the Shinsengumi's chief.

01:01:09.000 --> 01:01:11.540
Kill Kondou-san？

01:01:12.020 --> 01:01:14.260
We'll get to the details later,

01:01:15.060 --> 01:01:16.920
but Itou dies.

01:01:22.460 --> 01:01:25.280
You're Itou Kashitaro, right?

01:01:41.520 --> 01:01:43.700
Harada-san and company are late.

01:01:44.180 --> 01:01:46.380
Have they gone out drinking again?

01:01:47.220 --> 01:01:48.380
Um... I wonder...

01:01:48.720 --> 01:01:51.340
Yamazaki！Is Yamazaki here?！

01:01:51.860 --> 01:01:54.080
Quick！We need a doctor！

01:01:54.860 --> 01:01:57.440
Toudou-san please hold on!

01:01:56.540 --> 01:01:58.600
Nagakura-san, what happened?

01:02:00.940 --> 01:02:01.900
Heisuke-kun！

01:02:04.020 --> 01:02:09.400
Heisuke was attacked by the Guardians of the Imperial Tomb.

01:02:11.480 --> 01:02:13.020
The wound is too deep.

01:02:14.260 --> 01:02:16.500
There's nothing to be done.

01:02:16.920 --> 01:02:17.740
No, that can't...

01:02:18.160 --> 01:02:18.960
Toudou-kun.

01:02:22.060 --> 01:02:24.080
I need everyone to leave this room immediately.

01:02:24.460 --> 01:02:25.580
Sannan-san.

01:02:25.980 --> 01:02:28.840
Concede me this right, Yamzaki-kun.

01:02:32.200 --> 01:02:37.420
If there's nothing you can do, then please leave at once!

01:02:39.640 --> 01:02:40.360
Heisuke-kun...

01:02:47.860 --> 01:02:54.240
Toudo-kun, you're going to die unless you take this.

01:02:55.360 --> 01:02:56.240
What will you choose?

01:03:08.400 --> 01:03:09.360
Chizuro？

01:03:11.060 --> 01:03:13.300
Heisuke-kun, how are you feeling？

01:03:14.780 --> 01:03:17.660
I feel too good. It's kinda weird.

01:03:18.400 --> 01:03:19.260
I'm glad.

01:03:21.260 --> 01:03:23.400
I brought you some food, are you hungry？

01:03:23.700 --> 01:03:24.620
Thanks.

01:03:28.640 --> 01:03:30.160
So this is how a fury feels like...

01:03:36.680 --> 01:03:41.920
Don't worry. I would have died if not for that drug.

01:03:42.900 --> 01:03:43.920
Heisuke-kun...

01:03:45.180 --> 01:03:48.220
When you held me, your hands were so warm.

01:03:49.560 --> 01:03:53.640
All I could think was 'like hell I'm going to die here'.

01:03:54.520 --> 01:03:58.080
So don't blame yourself, alright?

01:03:59.160 --> 01:04:01.120
Thank you.

01:04:01.740 --> 01:04:03.980
I should be the one saying it.

01:04:04.440 --> 01:04:06.100
Thank you, Chizuro.

01:04:18.880 --> 01:04:22.020
The Shinsengumi have been ordered by the Shogun,

01:04:22.640 --> 01:04:25.040
to prepare for a war

01:04:25.600 --> 01:04:28.040
against the Choshu and Satsuma domains.

01:04:28.920 --> 01:04:32.800
This war is critical to preserve the Shogun's honor.

01:04:33.900 --> 01:04:36.520
We cannot fail！

01:05:10.000 --> 01:05:12.300
Nagumo-san, why are you here？

01:05:17.220 --> 01:05:18.060
Um…

01:05:20.820 --> 01:05:22.260
Where are we going?

01:05:39.040 --> 01:05:39.680
Father？

01:05:47.220 --> 01:05:48.440
You're safe！

01:05:48.620 --> 01:05:50.980
I was so worried about you!

01:05:52.760 --> 01:05:55.660
Sorry for not keeping in touch.

01:05:59.060 --> 01:06:02.020
Father, I need you to do something for the Shinsengumi…

01:06:02.020 --> 01:06:05.060
I need you to turn those furies back to humans.

01:06:06.860 --> 01:06:08.260
That's impossible.

01:06:09.620 --> 01:06:09.980
Eh？

01:06:12.160 --> 01:06:14.660
So you already know about it, Chizuro...

01:06:16.200 --> 01:06:19.580
That drug was made to create demons.

01:06:20.640 --> 01:06:23.240
To restore the power we once had....

01:06:23.540 --> 01:06:27.280
It's a necessary evil in order to get things back as they should be.

01:06:27.900 --> 01:06:28.880
As they…should be？

01:06:30.260 --> 01:06:33.620
I have never told you this before.

01:06:34.100 --> 01:06:37.800
But we are from an ancient line of demons.

01:06:38.040 --> 01:06:41.140
And you're the last remaining survivor of the Yukimura clan.

01:06:42.220 --> 01:06:46.220
All this is for your sake.

01:06:46.660 --> 01:06:50.720
What... What do you mean?

01:06:51.500 --> 01:06:55.260
We're here to take you back with us.

01:06:56.180 --> 01:06:59.280
The Shinsengumi's furies are a failure.

01:06:59.560 --> 01:07:03.980
But others have been researching the Water of Life.

01:07:04.500 --> 01:07:06.400
The shogunate will fall.

01:07:07.060 --> 01:07:10.740
You should leave the Shinsengumi before it happens, and come with us.

01:07:11.720 --> 01:07:13.780
I can't do that.

01:07:14.120 --> 01:07:16.580
Sooner or later, those humans will betray you.

01:07:16.580 --> 01:07:18.120
That's not true！

01:07:18.600 --> 01:07:21.020
I trust those people.

01:07:21.760 --> 01:07:23.640
Father, aren't you a doctor?

01:07:24.120 --> 01:07:25.900
Why... Why do such horrible things?

01:07:27.740 --> 01:07:31.420
Kodo-ojiisan, let's just take her.

01:07:31.780 --> 01:07:34.760
We can worry about changing her mind later.

01:07:36.600 --> 01:07:40.120
Don't come any closer, I'll attack you.

01:07:41.300 --> 01:07:43.460
What is that supposed to mean?

01:07:44.200 --> 01:07:46.320
It means she doesn't want to go.

01:07:47.540 --> 01:07:48.440
Hijikata-san!

01:07:55.380 --> 01:07:57.560
It's been a while, Kodo-san.

01:07:59.680 --> 01:08:02.820
Yes, Hijikata-san, it has been a while.

01:08:03.400 --> 01:08:05.560
Is everything you just said true?

01:08:06.300 --> 01:08:10.320
Do you have the habit of listening to other's conversations?

01:08:10.480 --> 01:08:13.960
I won't argue that the Shinsengumi's furies are a failure.

01:08:14.060 --> 01:08:18.320
But is it true there is no cure？

01:08:19.380 --> 01:08:24.500
It's really a shame you didn't see that from the start.

01:08:25.320 --> 01:08:29.220
You're being rude, rushing into something that's none of your business.

01:08:29.220 --> 01:08:33.800
Why, is this what you call a family meeting? We were real quiet, though.

01:08:34.260 --> 01:08:36.240
Nagakura-san! Saito-san！

01:08:36.740 --> 01:08:39.760
But that was the last straw.

01:08:39.980 --> 01:08:40.820
Harada-san！

01:08:41.700 --> 01:08:45.080
I see, so we have been followed from the start.

01:08:45.500 --> 01:08:46.740
That's how it is.

01:08:47.480 --> 01:08:51.240
You leave us no choice; Kaoru-kun, we have to retreat.

01:08:51.480 --> 01:08:52.120
But…

01:08:52.620 --> 01:08:55.440
It's alright, there's always another time.

01:08:57.540 --> 01:08:59.140
You better not regret this.

01:09:07.800 --> 01:09:11.080
You guys！Chase them, they can't be that far！

01:09:11.260 --> 01:09:12.000
Yes！

01:09:19.640 --> 01:09:20.520
I'm sorry.

01:09:21.660 --> 01:09:23.720
There's no need to apologize.

01:09:24.460 --> 01:09:26.820
But, because of me…

01:09:28.240 --> 01:09:32.480
If I stay here, I'll only be a burden.

01:09:33.880 --> 01:09:39.640
I don't have the right…to remain with you.

01:09:41.260 --> 01:09:44.900
If you don't want to remain here, I won't stop you.

01:09:46.420 --> 01:09:49.860
But, what is it that you really want?

01:09:55.180 --> 01:09:58.120
It's true we made a promise to protect you.

01:09:58.820 --> 01:10:02.840
But that's not the only reason why we do so.

01:10:03.780 --> 01:10:09.320
You care for the people in here, you would fight for us.

01:10:10.620 --> 01:10:13.360
That's enough reason for you to deserve to stay here.

01:10:26.360 --> 01:10:28.820
Hijikata-san, I...

01:10:30.560 --> 01:10:31.820
I want to stay!

01:10:35.040 --> 01:10:37.000
Toshi-san？Toshi-san are you here?

01:10:38.500 --> 01:10:42.180
Isami-san, Isami-san is...!!

01:10:45.480 --> 01:10:47.260
In his way back from Nijo castle,

01:10:47.260 --> 01:10:49.560
Kondou-san was shot by some of the remainging troups.

01:10:50.160 --> 01:10:54.020
Then did Kondou-san ride in his way back here?

01:10:54.260 --> 01:10:57.720
Yes. Please forgive me for not being able to protect him.

01:10:57.960 --> 01:11:03.580
No Kondou-san told me "If I bring more people it will increase the risk of me being pursued".

01:11:03.740 --> 01:11:05.700
And I wasn't able to convince him otherwise.

01:11:07.600 --> 01:11:11.700
Vice-commander, I've already treated his wound.

01:11:12.720 --> 01:11:14.220
But this night will determine wherever he lives or dies...

01:11:17.780 --> 01:11:19.040
Shinpachi. Harada.

01:11:19.460 --> 01:11:22.100
Go to where this happened and bring anyone suspicious.

01:11:22.480 --> 01:11:23.160
Yes!

01:11:23.880 --> 01:11:25.640
Leave the Shogun officials to Gen-san.

01:11:25.780 --> 01:11:26.680
Understood.

01:11:27.140 --> 01:11:28.980
Yamazaki, please tend to Kondou-san.

01:11:28.980 --> 01:11:29.620
Yes.

01:11:30.260 --> 01:11:32.840
As for you, go check on Souji.

01:11:33.400 --> 01:11:35.040
Yes, understood.

01:11:35.220 --> 01:11:38.120
Do not let him know about Kondou-san's condition.

01:12:01.800 --> 01:12:02.740
Okita-san？

01:12:06.320 --> 01:12:07.880
No, it can't be...

01:12:11.300 --> 01:12:13.100
How's the Fushimi's Shogunate Official?

01:12:13.640 --> 01:12:15.400
He's in a pretty bad state.

01:12:15.960 --> 01:12:18.060
Maybe he has even kicked it.

01:12:29.000 --> 01:12:30.640
That bastard... he's Shinsengumi!

01:12:46.860 --> 01:12:49.380
Were you the one who shot Kondou-san？

01:12:54.580 --> 01:12:56.240
What a surprise, Okita-san.

01:13:09.400 --> 01:13:13.080
I did not expect to see anyone with tuberculosis out of bed.

01:13:13.480 --> 01:13:15.320
But the rules are different for furies.

01:13:16.600 --> 01:13:18.260
Were you the one who shot Kondou-san？

01:13:18.720 --> 01:13:21.960
No.  Though I instigated it.

01:13:29.060 --> 01:13:30.700
What is your purpose？

01:13:31.460 --> 01:13:34.720
I want the people who changed Chizuro to disappear.

01:13:35.160 --> 01:13:36.120
And what does that mean？

01:13:36.740 --> 01:13:39.540
The Water of Life seems to have restored your strength,

01:13:39.900 --> 01:13:43.000
but you should know it won't cure tuberculosis.

01:13:43.860 --> 01:13:49.320
That really doesn't matter. As long as I can kill you…

01:14:17.500 --> 01:14:18.880
You're very good at avoiding,

01:14:20.500 --> 01:14:22.740
but there's no escaping now.

01:14:24.680 --> 01:14:27.400
Surely you must have expected me to have a trick.

01:14:38.000 --> 01:14:39.780
So you really did have it.

01:14:40.080 --> 01:14:42.060
But it's just one bullet...

01:14:43.220 --> 01:14:44.700
Is that what you think?

01:14:51.920 --> 01:14:52.520
Okita-san!

01:14:54.420 --> 01:14:58.460
Where are you, Okita-san？Okita-san！

01:15:00.360 --> 01:15:01.140
Okita-san！

01:15:01.380 --> 01:15:02.100
Souji!

01:15:05.440 --> 01:15:06.600
Okita-san! Okita-san!

01:15:06.940 --> 01:15:08.660
Souji, what happened?

01:15:12.960 --> 01:15:14.480
What's in that bullet?

01:15:15.160 --> 01:15:17.440
It seems to be made of silver.

01:15:18.460 --> 01:15:21.600
Is that the reason why Souji's wound isn't closing up?

01:15:22.140 --> 01:15:23.000
Probably.

01:15:23.400 --> 01:15:26.640
Usually when furies are hit with a bullet...

01:15:26.780 --> 01:15:28.640
The wound closes immediately.

01:15:28.800 --> 01:15:31.820
That means the enemy knew about the furie's weakness.

01:15:32.680 --> 01:15:33.120
Yes.

01:15:34.220 --> 01:15:36.760
It's safe to assume that.

01:15:50.360 --> 01:15:51.620
Do not retreat on me！

01:15:54.200 --> 01:15:57.240
We the 10th division will take care of this place.

01:15:57.480 --> 01:15:59.320
So go and rush ahead!

01:16:30.740 --> 01:16:33.220
This smell of blood tempting me...

01:16:34.500 --> 01:16:36.720
My humanity is slipping away.

01:16:40.020 --> 01:16:41.220
We did it！

01:16:54.000 --> 01:16:56.160
Am I not powerful?

01:16:56.820 --> 01:16:58.820
Already just a monster.

01:17:03.760 --> 01:17:04.880
What's the meaning of this?

01:17:05.520 --> 01:17:07.720
These are the last remaning bottles of the "Water of Life".

01:17:08.340 --> 01:17:11.600
You forcing us to drink that?

01:17:12.020 --> 01:17:15.140
Today we've already lost half of our forces.

01:17:15.860 --> 01:17:20.260
If the war continues like this, there's no guarantee we can survive it.

01:17:20.820 --> 01:17:25.720
If there ever comes a time where you feel you can't die yet, consider drinking it.

01:17:26.060 --> 01:17:30.740
I won't do it. I'm prepared to die out there.

01:17:37.940 --> 01:17:38.540
Toshi-san...

01:17:39.480 --> 01:17:45.600
We were given this drug by the Shogunate. You don't have to take responsibility for it.

01:17:46.540 --> 01:17:52.180
That's all on me and Kondo-san's, as Commander and Vice-commander.

01:17:52.720 --> 01:17:53.940
Understood.

01:17:54.380 --> 01:17:56.780
But it's a fact we're involved now.

01:17:57.160 --> 01:17:59.640
I'll take responsibility for my own decision.

01:18:02.940 --> 01:18:05.680
I know I'll have to takeresponsibility for it, as a man.

01:18:06.720 --> 01:18:10.660
But let me decide for myself to drink it or not.

01:18:14.500 --> 01:18:16.940
If someone like me can be of any help,

01:18:16.940 --> 01:18:19.260
then I'll keep one around in case it's needed.

01:18:33.040 --> 01:18:34.440
Someone guard the wounded.

01:18:34.980 --> 01:18:38.280
Bring those who still live!

01:18:38.580 --> 01:18:39.280
Here.

01:18:42.900 --> 01:18:45.360
Hijikata-san, how's the fight going?

01:18:46.020 --> 01:18:48.700
Yamazaki-kun is currently investigating it.

01:18:49.080 --> 01:18:50.440
All of you, please also take one.

01:18:51.320 --> 01:18:52.260
Thank you.

01:18:52.440 --> 01:18:53.560
I won't.

01:18:54.220 --> 01:18:55.980
Give them to the teams who need it most.

01:18:58.920 --> 01:19:02.440
It's alright. I already gave it to the others.

01:19:02.580 --> 01:19:03.520
Oh, alright then.

01:19:03.920 --> 01:19:05.060
Then, excuse me.

01:19:05.460 --> 01:19:07.060
Thank you, Yukimura.

01:19:07.180 --> 01:19:07.860
Here, you too.

01:19:08.280 --> 01:19:10.480
Well, now I have to take one.

01:19:10.780 --> 01:19:12.240
Hijikata-san, you too.

01:19:13.560 --> 01:19:14.240
Sorry for the trouble.

01:19:18.580 --> 01:19:19.780
Won't you eat it?

01:19:20.260 --> 01:19:21.080
In a little while.

01:19:24.340 --> 01:19:25.860
This one was pretty close.

01:19:26.520 --> 01:19:27.280
Really.

01:19:34.520 --> 01:19:37.580
Just as I thought, you're not taking any food yourself.

01:19:38.240 --> 01:19:39.400
Hijikata-san.

01:19:42.440 --> 01:19:45.360
Ah... I'm not doing much of anything.

01:19:45.540 --> 01:19:47.540
And I'm not really hungry.

01:19:47.600 --> 01:19:49.200
Don't give me that nonsense and eat.

01:19:49.720 --> 01:19:51.120
This war rages on.

01:19:51.780 --> 01:19:55.760
And who will take care of the men but you?

01:19:56.160 --> 01:19:58.560
But you also need to...

01:20:05.040 --> 01:20:05.540
Here.

01:20:08.520 --> 01:20:09.840
Thank you.

01:20:13.560 --> 01:20:14.300
Does it taste well?

01:20:19.580 --> 01:20:20.680
Vice-commander！

01:20:21.160 --> 01:20:22.140
Yamazaki-san!

01:20:22.140 --> 01:20:22.980
Yamazaki！

01:20:23.480 --> 01:20:28.720
The army, they…They raised the Emperor's banner！

01:20:29.220 --> 01:20:30.800
What?！

01:20:31.880 --> 01:20:33.680
Is is true?！

01:20:34.340 --> 01:20:37.900
That's outrageous, is that even possible!?

01:20:38.300 --> 01:20:41.740
* (maybe that they were enemies of the emperor before, and now they are with his banners?)

01:20:42.880 --> 01:20:43.700
Toshi-san.

01:20:43.820 --> 01:20:46.640
*(So this is where our cause leads us?)

01:20:49.620 --> 01:20:50.660
We're retreating!

01:20:51.340 --> 01:20:55.180
But we haven't lost. They'll pay for this.

01:20:56.980 --> 01:20:59.280
Someone has to take the wounded back.

01:20:59.760 --> 01:21:02.840
And we need another person to get reinforcements.

01:21:03.020 --> 01:21:04.160
I'll go.

01:21:05.140 --> 01:21:08.000
Please let me help you.

01:21:09.240 --> 01:21:10.600
I'll go with her.

01:21:11.720 --> 01:21:14.860
While we are away, please rest yourselves as much as possible.

01:21:15.420 --> 01:21:16.540
Inoue-san...

01:21:19.000 --> 01:21:21.180
Understood, then I'll leave it in your hands.

01:21:34.280 --> 01:21:36.680
That's... The Emperor's banner.

01:21:38.300 --> 01:21:39.480
Hurry up, Yukimura-kun.

01:21:47.360 --> 01:21:48.160
Someone's over there.

01:21:50.100 --> 01:21:51.460
Look out, Yukimura-kun!

01:21:53.840 --> 01:21:54.860
Inoue-san！

01:21:55.460 --> 01:21:57.680
Those blues, they are Shinsengumi.

01:21:58.520 --> 01:22:01.800
We take their heads and we can get a nice reward…

01:22:03.060 --> 01:22:03.920
How can this...

01:22:05.000 --> 01:22:08.040
You need to get back, Yukimura-kun.

01:22:08.680 --> 01:22:10.040
Inoe-san！

01:22:10.680 --> 01:22:14.180
You need to get back, and you need to tell Toshi.

01:22:14.800 --> 01:22:16.940
Tell him that I apologize for my weakness,

01:22:17.660 --> 01:22:21.920
and that I hope he'll forgive me for not staying with him to the end.

01:22:24.000 --> 01:22:30.080
Tell him that I don't have the words to thank him for giving a man like me the chance to be a part of something.

01:22:34.360 --> 01:22:36.820
Inoe-san!!

01:22:52.360 --> 01:22:55.580
Die, you bastard!

01:22:56.540 --> 01:23:02.440
What are you doing… Run away!

01:23:11.900 --> 01:23:15.400
Turning against your allies when the fight gets too complicated...

01:23:16.200 --> 01:23:18.880
How can you even consider yourselves warriors?

01:23:19.600 --> 01:23:20.520
What did you just say?!

01:23:20.760 --> 01:23:24.520
People like you don't even deserve to wipe the feet of real warriors.

01:23:25.100 --> 01:23:26.200
Shut up！

01:23:33.140 --> 01:23:34.180
Hijikata-san!

01:23:34.180 --> 01:23:35.180
Hijikata!

01:23:49.360 --> 01:23:50.060
Inoue-san.

01:23:56.440 --> 01:23:58.640
I've heard about the deflection of the Yodo clan.

01:23:59.260 --> 01:24:00.800
I got worried and came here.

01:24:02.060 --> 01:24:03.220
I'm sorry.

01:24:04.340 --> 01:24:06.060
I'm sorry I couldn't do anything.

01:24:13.840 --> 01:24:16.420
So the Shogun army kills within themselves.

01:24:17.480 --> 01:24:19.860
It isn't difficult to see how this war will end.

01:24:20.740 --> 01:24:23.780
The Satsuma-Choshu alliance is waving the Emperor's flag.

01:24:24.000 --> 01:24:27.440
And they have been authorized by Imperial decree.

01:24:28.180 --> 01:24:32.060
It's only a matter of time until you're exterminated.

01:24:33.140 --> 01:24:38.040
However, I'm only interested in taking this woman.

01:24:38.820 --> 01:24:42.180
Let me do that, and I'll let you live.

01:24:45.860 --> 01:24:46.640
I refuse.

01:24:47.920 --> 01:24:50.160
I will protect her.

01:24:51.080 --> 01:24:53.920
I... I made a promise!

01:24:56.220 --> 01:25:00.680
It's admirable when one doesn't back down.

01:25:01.640 --> 01:25:06.040
However you don't have the ability to protect this woman.

01:25:06.520 --> 01:25:08.820
Let's recognize the truth as it stands.

01:25:10.020 --> 01:25:11.240
Hijikata-san!

01:25:11.880 --> 01:25:12.680
Step back.

01:25:26.380 --> 01:25:28.260
Hijikata-san！

01:25:28.400 --> 01:25:31.060
Stay back！Don't come over here!

01:25:42.300 --> 01:25:44.220
Kazama-dono, are you alright?

01:25:44.520 --> 01:25:46.560
So this is the Shinsengumi…

01:25:47.260 --> 01:25:49.440
I didn't expect the Satsuma here...

01:25:49.560 --> 01:25:53.000
No wonder you know so much.

01:25:53.680 --> 01:25:54.680
Step aside.

01:25:56.620 --> 01:25:57.380
You're in the way.

01:25:58.220 --> 01:25:59.800
What...What are you doing?！

01:26:00.500 --> 01:26:04.060
Do not interfere with my fight.

01:26:11.020 --> 01:26:13.880
You won't last much with that wound,

01:26:14.660 --> 01:26:17.360
but I'll make it better.

01:26:17.360 --> 01:26:18.580
Stop it!

01:26:30.140 --> 01:26:30.780
Wait！

01:26:33.100 --> 01:26:34.300
The Water of Life,

01:26:35.420 --> 01:26:37.780
how much of a fool can you be?

01:26:39.000 --> 01:26:42.680
A fool？Like I care what you think.

01:26:48.700 --> 01:26:50.060
Hijikata-san！

01:26:50.060 --> 01:26:54.500
Even at their best a fury is just a pale immitation.

01:26:54.820 --> 01:26:56.480
You can't challenge me.

01:26:56.880 --> 01:27:01.720
Well, you never know until you try！

01:27:03.060 --> 01:27:05.620
No!

01:27:10.460 --> 01:27:12.460
I've had it.

01:27:13.120 --> 01:27:17.560
I've had it with the Shogun and you damned demons.

01:27:18.200 --> 01:27:20.860
Can't even protect someone I made a promise to.

01:27:21.380 --> 01:27:25.260
A fake, you say? And what if I am?

01:27:26.080 --> 01:27:31.580
Never in my whole life have they treated us like real warriors.

01:27:32.320 --> 01:27:36.300
But no matter what, our convictions will not bend.

01:27:37.300 --> 01:27:39.580
It doesn't matter if we are fake,

01:27:40.200 --> 01:27:43.260
you push long enough and you'll eventually become the real thing!

01:27:47.960 --> 01:27:50.340
C'mon! That all you've got?!

01:27:55.820 --> 01:28:01.100
How does it feel to get cut by a fake, demon?

01:28:03.260 --> 01:28:06.720
Disgusting! This is unforgivable!

01:28:07.040 --> 01:28:09.180
You bastard!

01:28:27.780 --> 01:28:29.660
Kazama, that's enough.

01:28:30.420 --> 01:28:33.980
We need to leave, you can't continue to play.

01:28:44.860 --> 01:28:46.820
Your name is Toshizo Hijikata, isn't it?

01:28:47.420 --> 01:28:50.540
We will continue this another day.

01:29:25.400 --> 01:29:27.240
Don't leave my side, no matter what happens.

01:29:28.080 --> 01:29:30.760
I will protect you...

01:29:33.020 --> 01:29:34.800
I will take you back to Edo.

01:29:39.200 --> 01:29:39.640
Alright.

01:29:48.460 --> 01:29:49.220
Are you afraid?

01:29:49.380 --> 01:29:50.120
No.

01:29:50.360 --> 01:29:52.440
Not as long as I'm with you, Hijikata-san.
